WEBVTT

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.376
to use a boxing analogy.

00:06:30.718 --> 00:06:34.877
Just one CAR T cell can kill
1,000 tumor cells.

00:06:35.697 --> 00:06:38.599
That's right -- it's a ratio
of one to a thousand.

00:06:38.623 --> 00:06:41.641
The CAR T cell and
its daughter progeny cells

00:06:41.665 --> 00:06:44.101
can divide and divide
and divide in the body

00:06:44.125 --> 00:06:46.260
until the last tumor cell is gone.

00:06:46.284 --> 00:06:48.833
There's no precedent for this
in cancer medicine.

00:06:49.379 --> 00:06:52.559
The first two patients
who had full remission

00:06:52.583 --> 00:06:55.659
remain today leukemia-free,

00:06:55.683 --> 00:06:57.273
and we think they are cured.

00:06:57.297 --> 00:06:59.772
These are people
who had run out of options,